1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,320
(Katee Sackhoff:)George, let me
ask you something.

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,190
(Katee Sackhoff:)How did you deal
with being typecast

3
00:00:04,190 --> 00:00:05,650
(Katee Sackhoff:)as a science fiction icon?

4
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,190
(George Takei:)It's difficult.

5
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:09,060
(George Takei:)You try and stretch
as an actor--

6
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,490
(George Takei:)do Strindberg, O'Neill,

7
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:14,600
(George Takei:)but all they want is,
"Course laid in, Captain."

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,860
(Katee Sackhoff:)Tell me about it.

9
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:19,130
(Katee Sackhoff:)It's frackin'
frustrating.

10
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:21,370
(Howard:)Wait. Katee,
why are you leaving?

11
00:00:21,370 --> 00:00:24,340
(Bernadette:)She's leaving because you
really want to be with me.

12
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:27,910
MRS. WOLOWITZ:
Howard, I found my girdle!

13
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,580
(Mrs Wolowitz:)It was in the dryer!

14
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,280
(Howard:)Great, Ma!

15
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,720
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I think it shrunk!

16
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:37,050
(Mrs Wolowitz:)I'm spilling out like
the Pillsbury Doughboy here!

17
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,190
(Howard:)And with that mental picture,

18
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:41,760
(Howard:)I think we're done
for the evening.

19
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:49,470
(Leonard:)You know, you never
told me what happened

20
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:50,800
(Leonard:)between you
and Bernadette.

21
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,400
(Howard:)I did a stupid thing.

22
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,840
(Leonard:)Yeah, I guessed that.

23
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,370
(Howard:)It was the kind of thing

